---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Riverside Cottages"
  description="Riverside Cottages Discover more with our Khao Sok FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Riverside Cottages"
  heroSubtitle="Handcrafted Wooden Lodging Beside the Sok River"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Category", "href": "/faq-category/"}, {"label": "Riverside Cottages", "href": "/faq-category/riverside-cottages/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What is your Cancellation Policy?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The policy is very simple - we do not take any deposits and rely on the honor system. This means it is extremely important that you let us know ASAP if you need to change or cancel your reservation. To cancel or change a reservation please email reservations: khaosokriver@gmail.com Or Phone: (+66) 77 395- 159
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring when I visit Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Bring cool and quick-drying clothing, a bathing suit, hat, good walking shoes that you don’t mind getting wet (water shoes are never a bad idea!), a flashlight, sun protection, personal medicines, and toiletries. Shirts or pants with button pockets best for jungle hikes so you don’t lose things. Wine, beer, raincoats, mosquito repellent, and other necessities are available here. Planning on visiting Cheow Larn Lake? Take a minute to read through our Top Tips for your Lake trip, and come prepared! If you have any questions, just let us know!
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can you arrange tours for us?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can book your activities with us once you get here, or you can book a package in advance. Find details of available Khao Sok tours and activities here
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What facilities do you provide at Riverside Cottages?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Laundry, international phone, and internet are available. Mobile phones may be used but signal might be weak. All houses have 24-hour electricity, but brown-out or black-outs may occur, usually lasting only a few minutes or at most a few hours. Find details of our facilities here.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Do you accept credit cards?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Unfortunately, we are currently unable to accept credit cards at the resort. There is an ATM in the nearby town if you need to withdraw cash.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Do you have a restaurant?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, we have a full service bar and restaurant that is open every day at 7:30 AM. We take the last order at 8:30 PM.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is breakfast included in the room rate?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Breakfast is not included in the standard room rate, but it is included if you book one of our packages.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What time is check in and check out?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Check in is from 2:00pm. Check out is anytime before 12:00pm. If you are arriving after 8:30pm, you must inform us ahead of time, or you cannot check in.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do I get to Riverside Cottages?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok Riverside Cottages is 2km east of Khao Sok town. A link to a map and directions can be found at the bottom of this page. Please let us know when you plan to arrive. If you would like us to send a private car, we can pick you up anywhere in Southern Thailand – please contact us for details. If you come via public transport, please follow the directions below. Get off at the Khao Sok Bus Stop (this is also where public vans stop). We have a free shuttle, and our driver is often at the bus stop – he will be holding [...]
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
